  "body": "Check 2D and 3D Adaptive (Trochoidal) clean-up passes against the cutter radial engagement limit across every `max_engagement` setting, including the 90.0 deg default.\n\n### Summary of Changes\n- **Checked clean-up ladder (`crates/motion/src/machining2d/adaptive_troch_clean.rs`, `adaptive_troch_check.rs`, `adaptive_troch.rs`, `adaptive_troch_level.rs`, `crates/motion/src/machining3d/troch.rs`)**:\n  - Added `plan_cleanup_checked` to measure clean-up chains against the single-level post-lane stock at all `max_engagement` limits.\n  - Added automatic step-down along `CLEANUP_LADDER` (`1.0`, `0.75`, `0.5`, `0.35`, `0.25`) when baseline clean-up exceeds `t.max_engagement`, and recorded the peel-step reduction note.\n  - Restored the whole-path `GenError::Invalid` refusal for custom `max_engagement` settings (`docs/decisions/3849-trochoidal-cleanup-engagement.md`), and emitted a named note with level Z (`at (x, y, z)`) when clean-up at the 90.0 deg default still exceeds the limit after step-down.\n- **Advisory warning and UI group (`crates/sim/src/verify/types.rs`, `crates/app/src/operation/generate.rs`, `crates/app/src/warned_moves.rs`, `crates/app/src/mcp/job.rs`, `crates/ui/src/operations.rs`)**:\n  - Added advisory `Warning::EngagementExceeded { at, measured_deg, limit_deg }` (`blocks_post() == false`) pointing to the clean-up feed move nearest the measured peak at the note Z.\n  - Exposed `\"engagement_exceeded\"` in MCP job warnings and added its own status-line warning group in the UI.\n- **No new top-level test binary (`crates/motion/tests/adaptive_troch_parallel/clean.rs`)**:\n  - Placed the six clean-up engagement tests inside the existing `adaptive_troch_parallel` directory suite instead of adding a new top-level binary, because its Gate map already covers `adaptive_troch_clean` and shares `common/adaptive_troch.rs`.\n\n### Readings\n- `wide 30x24 D6` and `L-shape D10` at `max_engagement = 60.0` deg: measured `64.0` deg and `62.5` deg at scale `1.0`; after step-down they hold `<= 60.0` deg, post clean, and carry the peel-step reduction note without `Warning::EngagementExceeded`.\n- Notch pocket (`20 x 14`, 7 mm notch, 6 mm cutter) at `90.0` deg default: measured `118.5` deg on `upstream/main` with no note; on this branch it steps down to `97.5` deg, emits `Warning::EngagementExceeded` on clean-up move `2137`, and does not block the post.\n- Notch pocket at `75.0` deg custom limit: whole-path refusal fires near `95.5` deg.\n\n### Screenshots\nOff-screen renders (`egui_kittest` and headless `wgpu`, no window opened) show operation A1 on the notch pocket (`20 x 14`, 7 mm notch, 6 mm tool, 90.0 deg default) with the Properties status banner expanded.\n\n| Before (`upstream/main` `41b441762`) | After (this PR, `f7d795b0c`) |\n|---|---|\n| ![before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/2cef218ca8e9434c1151eb4ad0d194e033d606d7/4008/status-line-before.png) | ![after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/81bad0ef67351469ae3259218e0288d70b98ffbf/4008/status-line-after.png) |\n| `OK · 676 moves`. No warning. | `OK · 2246 moves · 1 warning` (`clean-up engagement measured 97.5 deg from move 2137, above the 90.0 deg limit`). |\n\n### Verification (head `f7d795b0c7a3d5e6cbb4256b73b0a1b1bcecc8ac`)\nAll verification ran in software and simulation tests (not on a mill):\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: 321/321 steps green (`318` non-UI steps including `app suites: example_catalog` 43 passed / 4 ignored, `example_catalog_adaptive` 1 passed, `example_catalog_edge_work` 1 passed, `golden_cl` 34 passed; plus `ui build`, `ui suites: lib` 1,651 passed / 8 ignored, and `ui suites: operations` 31 passed via `--failed` after clearing stale seeded `serde_spanned`/`toml`/`kittest`/`accesskit_consumer` units).\n- `cargo clippy -j 6 -p camcraft-motion -p camcraft-sim -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: pass (exit 0).\n- `cargo xtask gate light`: 6 steps, 0 failed, 0 stalled (11 light twins passed).\n- Targeted heavy step (`P1` under the safety floor): `cargo xtask gate heavy --base upstream/main --only \"motion heavy: adaptive_troch_parallel\" --only \"motion heavy: adaptive_troch_neck\" --only \"motion heavy: adaptive_troch_island\"` — 3 steps, 0 failed, 0 stalled (7 heavy tests passed: `island` 2, `neck` 3, `parallel` 2).\n- Pinning tests:\n  - `motion adaptive_troch_parallel::clean::cleanup_over_the_default_limit_is_named` (red on main at 118.5 deg without a warning)\n  - `motion adaptive_troch_parallel::clean::cleanup_steps_down_to_a_custom_limit_wide`\n  - `motion adaptive_troch_parallel::clean::cleanup_steps_down_to_a_custom_limit_l_shape`\n  - `motion adaptive_troch_parallel::clean::a_custom_limit_the_whole_path_cannot_hold_is_refused`\n  - `app adaptive_trochoid::an_over_limit_cleanup_warns_on_its_own_move_through_the_real_generator`\n  - `app adaptive_trochoid::a_custom_limit_cleanup_steps_down_and_posts_without_a_warning`\n  - `app adaptive_trochoid::cleanup_engagement_warning_names_the_feed_through_the_peak`\n  - `app pocket3d_trochoid::an_over_limit_cleanup_level_warns_on_its_own_move`\n  - `ui operations::warning_fold_tests::engagement_exceeded_surfaces_as_advisory_status_line_and_keeps_own_group`\n- `git merge-tree --write-tree upstream/main f7d795b0c`: clean (exit 0); no golden files or snapshot PNGs changed.\n\n### Not Exercised\n- Remaining 104 reached heavy-lane steps outside the targeted trochoidal binaries (deferred to the cut gate) and physical mill runs.\n\nfork synced at v0.26.0\nChangelog: Checked 2D and 3D Adaptive (Trochoidal) clean-up passes against the engagement limit with automatic step-down and a named advisory warning.\nEffort: high\n\nFixes #3849",
